  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Spell point pool.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may reduce the spellpoint cost of an ability or sphere effect by 1 SP, to a minimum of 1 SP cost, by increasing your wild magic chance by 50% for that ability or effect. At character level 10, you may double both the reduction and wild magic chance increase.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/wild-magic-feats#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
